      "updated": 1785748307900,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "for each adjacent pair:\n  if prices[i] < prices[i+1]\n     profit += prices[i+1] - prices[i]\n\nCollect every rising step = max total profit",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "index": "a6",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "for each adjacent pair:\n  if prices[i] < prices[i+1]\n     profit += prices[i+1] - prices[i]\n\nCollect every rising step = max total profit",
